P actions make_etude
P memjob 3072000
P memory_limit 3000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterLinToQuad
P version stable
A memjeveux 512.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 9000.0
F mmed AsterLinToQuad.med D  20
F comm AsterLinToQuad.comm D  1
F rmed AsterLinToQuad.rmed R  80
F mess AsterLinToQuad.log R  6
